        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>How to Treat Online Education?</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      color: #111;\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 66px 6px 48px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n    .title {\n      display: inline-block;\n      margin: 0 0 7px;\n      padding: 0 2px;\n      background: #fff200;\n      font-family: Arial, \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 1.2;\n    }\n    .section-title {\n      height: 20px;\n      margin: 0 0 2px;\n      padding: 0 0 0 3px;\n      background: #d1d1d1;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 20px;\n    }\n    .section-title .bullet {\n      display: inline-block;\n      width: 18px;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      vertical-align: 1px;\n    }\n    .section-title .en {\n      display: inline-block;\n      width: 82px;\n    }\n    .section-title .cn {\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", serif;\n    }\n    .point {\n      position: relative;\n      margin: 0 0 3px 45px;\n      padding-left: 23px;\n      text-align: justify;\n    }\n    .point::before {\n      content: \"○\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 0;\n      left: 0;\n      color: #48a9c8;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    .red {\n      color: #e00000;\n      text-decoration: underline;\n      text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n      text-underline-offset: 2px;\n    }\n    .blue {\n      color: #008ec8;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", serif;\n      font-size: 16px;\n    }\n    .intro .point {\n      margin-bottom: 0;\n    }\n    .indent {\n      display: inline-block;\n      width: 0;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"title\">如何看待线上教育?</div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span><span class=\"en\">Introduction</span><span class=\"cn\">开头</span></div>\n    <div class=\"intro\">\n      <div class=\"point\">\n        <span class=\"red\">The pandemic is ranging across the globe, and students are reeling from it.</span><br>\n        <span class=\"blue\">（背景）</span> During the lockdown, students have no other choice but to study<br>\n        from home, making online education more popular. <span class=\"blue\">（引出话题）</span> <span class=\"red\">In my<br>view, it has both pros and cons, and should be used wisely.</span> <span class=\"blue\">（抛出观点）</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span><span class=\"en\">Pros</span><span class=\"cn\">好处</span></div>\n    <div class=\"point\">\n      For students, online education is more flexible. <span class=\"red\">Rather than being<br>restricted in classrooms,</span> learners can sign up for any course they are<br>\n      interested in as long as they have access to the Internet. <span class=\"blue\">（对于学生，<br>课程选择更加灵活）</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"point\">\n      For teachers, they don’t need to make the <span class=\"red\">roll call</span>, because the system can<br>\n      record automatically. Besides, they can also assign, collect and review the<br>\n      homework more conveniently. <span class=\"blue\">（对于老师，教学更加便捷）</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span><span class=\"en\">Cons</span><span class=\"cn\">不足</span></div>\n    <div class=\"point\">\n      Online courses may be effective for <span class=\"red\">self-directed</span> learners, but students<br>\n      who are not organized and not in possession of good time-management skills<br>\n      may struggle. <span class=\"blue\">（对于自驱型学习者有效，反之，效果不佳）</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"point\">\n      Online education is lacking in teacher-student interaction. It’s more<br>\n      difficult for teachers to ask feedbacks from students. And students also<br>\n      can’t ask questions immediately. <span class=\"blue\">（师生间缺少互动）</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span><span class=\"en\">Conclusion</span><span class=\"cn\">结论</span></div>\n    <div class=\"point\">\n      Therefore, students should ask themselves whether they are capable of<br>\n      learning independently before signing up for online coursework. <span class=\"blue\">（所以在<br>参与线上课程之前，学生首先应该对自己的自主学习能力有所判断）</span>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
